8	/**
9	 * Rejects a new owner whose city already contains {@link #CAPACITY} or more owners, so the request is
10	 * answered with a 409 Conflict rather than exceeding the per-city capacity. Cities are compared in
11	 * their {@link OwnerCity#normalize normalized} form (whitespace collapsed, lower-cased), consistent
12	 * with the other create-time checks. Runs after {@link CheckIdentityUnique} and before
13	 * {@link BuildOwner}.
14	 */
15	public class CheckCityCapacity {
16	
17	    /** Maximum number of owners permitted per city. */
